uld someone do this this will take  forever to sort out  so poor miss june has had the labels on  some of her mushrooms go missing  and as a result she can no longer tell  which are the deadly ones and which are  the benign ones that go good on salads  so chris bell vows that she'll help her  out and so one thing that you might try  to do  is take a look in the past and see where  the labels were in the past  unfortunately what you'll see is that  actually it's blocked in the past so you  can't really see  it because there's this box however what  we can do is send our buddy matthias the  frog here  into the past where he becomes a tiny  little tadpole  and in this mode he can walk around and  interact with the people the places and  the things of the past and in this  instance he can actually push this box  aside  and reveal the information that we're  looking for  well this one has a skull on it i  imagine this is the death cap  having done that we can now take that  information back to the present  and we can now go retrieve the missing  label which we happen to know  these kids stole and bring it back to  poor miss june  this is it  [Music]  miss june we found your label so now  that we've uh helped her out ms june  will help us out with our quest  and so we asked her about the green leaf  tonic and she tells us that we'll need  some glow fruit in order to be able to  make green leaf tonic  fortunately i know where some glow fruit  happens to be  this is the world map like i mentioned  this is a  classic jrpg so it does have world map  vehicles  inns shops uh turn-based combat which  i'll be showing off in a little bit as  well the tree i planted  but the fruit is going to take forever  to grow  of course in this specific instance  before we get there uh we need to  recover some glow fruit  what you'll see here is that this tree  does not exist in the present  it only exists in the future but of  course we can send our buddy matthias  the frog here  into the future where he's old and fat  he can get the glow fruit  retrieve it and bring it back to us in  the present  we can take the glow fruit back to june  in order to  get that green leaf tonic that we've  been looking for  i have glow fruit will one be enough  that  and so now that we've given the  apothecary the glow fruit she has given  us the green leaf tonic  well unfortunately we have another  problem here  there's only one dose of tonic and  there's two houses that are ruined  so we have to make a decision do we save  the apothecary shop  the town's medicine comes from here what  about poor miss miller  you know she she has a young daughter  who's going to grow up and it looks like  she's pregnant and has another one on  the way in the future  which of these two should we save i'm  going to choose to save miss miller's  in this house  and what you'll see is that by making  this decision in the present it actually  changes the future keep an eye on ms  miller's house on the right  these kinds of changes and decisions  that you can make permeate  all throughout the story there are so  many different things that you can  interact with in the past and in the  future  and i'll be showing you many of those  things as we move along here  the kinds of decisions that you can make  in this game range from very small like  the color of a house  to things that impact the futures of  entire kingdoms  and so i'll show you some of that some  of those differences right now  so if we come up here we can see uh  young bernard who is trying to make a  living right now  as a street performer in the past you'll  see he always loved to play his violin  you'll see that in the present he's  trying to eke out a living and in the  future  unfortunately it doesn't look like it's  worked out and he is forced into a life  of crime  but depending on what happens to him  that future could change  as you see here now not all choices are  small in crystals  some decisions may affect the future of 