en  all of that fire damage  and so that damage all comes in and hits  it at once is one giant burst  and of course this doesn't only work  with with fire it works with  regen spells and things like that poison  as well as  other uh more off-the-wall things so for  example  in the public demo that we have out  there there's an enemy that can only be  defeated  by rusting its metal shield by first  getting it wet and then sending it into  the future  similarly you can have plants that will  grow much bigger if you first use a  water spell on them and then send them  into the future  so there are many different interactions  between chris bell's time powers  and the various status effects and  ailments that can be applied to enemies  during combat now um  this is not the only system that adds  complexity and depth to what's going on  in the combat  there's actually more even on top of  just this  so there's also a system called the  syncro system and there i failed to  defend myself  but there's also a system called the  syncro system which i'll be showing off  now  which allows chris bell to use her time  powers to speed up an  ally so that he can create crazy combos  so for example here uh we'll invoke the  syncro  with wilhelm and uh do his yuka reign  and have him uh heal the party and  send a whole bunch of exploding plant  bombs at this enemy over here  and so here you'll see chris bell using  her time powers to accelerate wilhelm  and let him take a whole bunch of  actions all at once  boom and so uh we can go ahead you'll  notice when you're attacking across time  you send out an astral projection of  yourself  as well so the synchro system allows  chris bell to  set up combos with her different  characters so for example  christopher here has a water spell which  gets enemies wet and makes them more  susceptible to lightning  and also has a lightning spell so you  can set up a combo with him  that involves starting with the water  spell and then  proceeding i